error[unresolved-type] 6:23-6:24
      (map (fn [r] (get r :size)) acc)
                        ^
  The checker cannot tell which record this is, so it cannot read a field from it.
  A loop binding that starts as [], {}, or none gets its type from the values that recur gives it, and no recur here does. Give recur a value of the right shape, or start the binding with one.
